1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,354
Every stone you take goes on your board.

2
00:00:02,674 --> 00:00:03,591
But where?

3
00:00:03,911 --> 00:00:05,106
Let's find out.

4
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:07,541
Look at Ana's board.

5
00:00:07,861 --> 00:00:10,485
It has five parts, one for each animal.

6
00:00:10,805 --> 00:00:12,554
Each part is called a section.

7
00:00:13,666 --> 00:00:15,693
Let's zoom in on the Turtle's section.

8
00:00:16,013 --> 00:00:18,423
The empty circles are where stones go.

9
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:21,111
Each animal is picky.

10
00:00:21,431 --> 00:00:23,842
It only takes stones that match its rule.

11
00:00:24,162 --> 00:00:26,167
The rule is written under its name.

12
00:00:27,299 --> 00:00:29,710
The Turtle's rule is: all one color.

13
00:00:31,283 --> 00:00:32,968
Ana gives it a red stone.

14
00:00:33,288 --> 00:00:34,269
That fits!

15
00:00:35,399 --> 00:00:37,298
Next, she takes the blue stone.

16
00:00:37,618 --> 00:00:38,898
Blue is not red.

17
00:00:39,218 --> 00:00:41,074
So blue can't go on this Turtle.

18
00:00:42,949 --> 00:00:44,464
But blue fits the Salmon.

19
00:00:44,784 --> 00:00:46,939
The Salmon wants all different colors.

20
00:00:48,066 --> 00:00:50,285
What if a stone fits nowhere on your board?

21
00:00:50,605 --> 00:00:52,354
Then it goes back into the bowl.

22
00:00:53,466 --> 00:00:54,554
Now, points.

23
00:00:54,874 --> 00:00:58,415
The gold numbers at the bottom show what the animal can score.

24
00:00:59,533 --> 00:01:02,711
The big number in the corner shows its points right now.

25
00:01:03,833 --> 00:01:06,286
All five animals add up to your total.

26
00:01:06,606 --> 00:01:08,377
It's at the top right of the board.

27
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,396
Remember.

28
00:01:10,715 --> 00:01:12,828
Each animal has its own section.

29
00:01:13,147 --> 00:01:15,281
A stone must match that animal's rule.

30
00:01:15,601 --> 00:01:18,374
If it fits nowhere, it goes back to the bowl.

31
00:01:18,694 --> 00:01:20,913
Next: meet the first three animals.
